 RSS 作者将停止维护该项目</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tiny Tiny RSS 作者将停止维护该项目&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;项目作者在 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1522?q=%23TTRSS"&gt;#TTRSS&lt;/a&gt; 官方论坛发布：&lt;a href="https://community.tt-rss.org/t/the-end-of-tt-rss-org/7164" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;The end of tt-rss.org&lt;/a&gt;，宣布11月1日终止该项目。目前已有项目贡献者 fork 源码、插件、文档等并转载至 GitHub ，且愿意接棒项目开发和运维：&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/tt-rss/tt-rss" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://github.com/tt-rss/tt-rss&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;发现于&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://x.com/JeffreyCalm/status/1977632807418745277" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://x.com/JeffreyCalm/status/1977632807418745277&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/Wc-etl4plMqchHPDevUPLIIA6MbE-rpeexuK6vnbQWoIWvqPZ2UdvnPJ0L-zwbnA7D0PeKvEhiLcN4vmMJ7nVf93ZY5LMaMs65q7f82QSnoaFaOM7lChyFDUVyoSABhGCGrZpz9Ka90qvcZScKvIR_Os2z5egzmEBPWYP7IkL22ow00MPq8jsmlsM54yjiuErn6nVtzNQKxYgsluczY-mHSBByiZYECTv42rFcXA_RXNnSu21J6AIBwQOlo7_oAD2leutaBQ1r_Zmn0JvjS-2kdGANZPv16nfy004AcLFdrIV-fHpugbjOzMpVvFm6xgS0FTNqa6Ln0cnhU_HngAQw.jpg" width="800" height="411" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1522</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1522</guid><pubDate>Mon, 13 Oct 2025 15:00:46 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 rssrssrssrss: 一个 feed 合并工具</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;rssrssrssrss: 一个 feed 合并工具&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;感谢&lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/issues/119" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;投稿&lt;/a&gt;，向我们推荐了由 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1382" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Buttondown&lt;/a&gt; 开发并 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1521?q=%23%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90"&gt;#开源&lt;/a&gt; 的一个 RSS feed 合并工具：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt